--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODIFICATIONS MADE FOR THE PUBLIC TEMPLATE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Invisible-UX (session-key) authentication removed.
   Player-facing actions (create / join / draw / claim / refund) are now
   authenticated by the transaction sender instead of a session-key signature.
   The `RegisterSession` / `RevokeSession` execute messages and the session
   query endpoints were removed together with the session module itself
   (see contracts/common/NOTICE).

2. The `paxi-common` dependency was changed from an out-of-tree relative path
   to the vendored, self-contained copy at `../../common`, so that the template
   can be cloned, built and published on its own.

3. Tier configuration and price amounts are being turned into InstantiateMsg
   parameters, and game-specific hardcoding is being externalised.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SECURITY NOTE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Randomness is provided by a commit-reveal scheme with a block-hash fallback
(`RandomSource::CommitReveal` / `RandomSource::BlockHashFallback`). See
docs/security-notes.md in the repository root for the full description and for
the residual risks of the fallback path.
